help-sidebar.control.item.create-clone-o:
Create a new clone of the `sprite_class` Sprite.  Any `@pytch.when_I_start_as_a_clone` methods will run for that new clone.

```
class Apple(pytch.Sprite):
    @pytch.when_key_pressed("n")
    def make_new_Banana(self):
        self.create_clone_of(Banana)
```

(You might see `pytch.create_clone_of()`, which also works, in older code.)
